[TITLE]
InpWriter round-trip fixture: unsteady-friction option keys (issue #156)
UNSTEADY_FRICTION and UF_K3 are inert in this build — no solver reads them — so the
only way a save can lose them is the writer. Both are set to NON-DEFAULT values here
(the default is NONE / 0.015), which is what makes the loss visible: a writer that
drops the keys re-parses back to the defaults instead of failing to load.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
UNSTEADY_FRICTION    VITKOVSKY
UF_K3                0.02
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             01:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             01:00:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:30
MIN_SLOPE            0

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J1       10.0  5.0       0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev  Type  StageData  Gated
O1       8.0   FREE  *          NO

[CONDUITS]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Length  Roughness  InOffset  OutOffset
C1       J1        O1      400.0   0.013      0         0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link  Shape     Geom1  Geom2  Geom3  Geom4  Barrels
C1       CIRCULAR  1.5    0      0      0      1

[REPORT]
INPUT       NO
CONTROLS    NO
NODES       ALL
LINKS       ALL

[COORDINATES]
;;Node  X-Coord  Y-Coord
J1       0.0      0.0
O1       500.0    0.0
